| **G1.1: Collect Required Resources**             | Navigate to storages, request and wait for the required resources to be retrieved.                                                                             | G1.1.1 ; FALLBACK(G1.1.2)                  | Perform      | N/A (activity execution)                                                                                                    | Sequential (with fallback) | The collection phase involves sequential actions (navigation, request, wait) but if the battery is low, the fallback branch (return to recharge and reassign) is executed.                                                                         |
